---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const prose = "prose prose-base max-w-none prose-headings:text-base-content prose-p:text-base-content/90 prose-li:text-base-content/90 prose-a:text-primary hover:prose-a:text-primary/80 prose-strong:text-base-content";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy – cassini.talk"
  description="Privacy information for cassini.talk and links to the iPhone, iPad and Android privacy policies."
>
  <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-20 pg-hero flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-6">
    <h1 class="font-bold text-base-content" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-base-content/60 text-balance" style="max-width: 36rem">Your recordings and transcripts stay on your device. Read the policy for your app below.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="w-full mx-auto px-5 md:px-10 pg-last" style="max-width: 46rem">
    <div class={prose}>
      <h2>Privacy policies for your app</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/privacy/ios/">iPhone and iPad privacy policy</a>, including information about model downloads, Apple services and your rights.</li>
        <li><a href="/privacy/android/">Android privacy information</a>, including local storage, model downloads, sharing and deletion.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These pages describe the platform-specific behaviour. For iPhone and iPad, you can also read <a href="/privacy/ios/technical/">the technical details</a>.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Cassini talk is published by Codemyriad OÜ, registry code 17142537, Järvevana tee 9, 11314 Tallinn, Estonia. For privacy questions, write to <a href="mailto:team@codemyriad.io">team@codemyriad.io</a>.</p>

      <h2>Recordings and transcripts</h2>
      <p>Recording, transcription and speaker analysis run on your device. We do not receive your recordings, transcripts or voiceprints. The apps have no user accounts or advertising. When you choose to export or share content, the recipient handles that copy under their own terms.</p>

      <h2>Model downloads</h2>
      <p>When you agree to download models, our hosting provider, Cloudflare, receives your IP address and technical request data to deliver the files and keep the service running. The iPhone and iPad policy describes the legal basis, our legitimate interest under GDPR Article 6(1)(f), and model-download log retention of up to 12 months. Read your app’s policy above for the details of its downloads and any platform services it uses.</p>

      <h2>This website and app downloads</h2>
      <p>This website uses no cookies, analytics scripts or third-party trackers. Cloudflare hosts the website and download files and processes IP addresses and request details to deliver them and operate the service. Requests may be logged for service operation and security. App stores, GitHub and platform update services also process requests under their own terms.</p>

      <h2>Your rights and questions</h2>
      <p>For the limited personal data we process, contact <a href="mailto:team@codemyriad.io">team@codemyriad.io</a> to ask about access, erasure or restriction, or to object to processing. You can also complain to the <a href="https://www.aki.ee/en">Estonian Data Protection Inspectorate</a> or the authority where you live. The app policies above provide further details.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
